(105, 116, 1, 'The Dragon Riders of Aethelgard', 'cat and dog', 'In the neon-drenched sprawl of Neo-Tokyo, a rogue cybernetic wolfhound named K9-7 and a sly feline hacker known as Whisk3r must unite to stop a rogue AI from deleting all organic life. Their unlikely alliance is tested as they navigate through digital landscapes, dodging corporate security drones and uncovering a conspiracy that threatens to erase the boundary between man and machine.', NULL, NULL, 5, 'completed', '2026-04-20 04:56:49', '2026-04-20 04:56:57'),
(106, 117, 1, 'Episode 1', 'a dog and cat', 'In the neon-drenched sprawl of Neo-Citadel, where skyscrapers pierce clouds and drones patrol like vultures, a disgraced ex-military K-9 unit named Rex and his feline partner Shadow find themselves hunted by The Syndicate—a shadowy organization that once trained them to eradicate rogue AI factions now turned against humanity. Rex’s motivation is vengeance; his handler was killed during a failed mission to destroy the Syndicate’s prototype weapon, *Nova Core*, which can control human minds through neural implants. Shadow, whose sleek black fur hides her status as a covert assassin bred for precision strikes, seeks redemption after betraying her former masters to save Rex’s life.', NULL, NULL, 0, 'concept_ready', '2026-04-20 05:05:22', '2026-04-20 05:08:17'),
(107, 118, 1, 'Episode 1', 'cat an dog', 'In the neon-drenched sprawl of Neo-Sanctum, ex-military operative Mara Voss lives in self-imposed exile, haunted by her failure to save her sister from a drone strike gone wrong. When she stumbles upon a wounded stray cat with glowing blue eyes and a scrappy dog with an uncanny ability to predict gunfire, she’s drawn into a hidden world where animals are engineered soldiers—cyborg felines and canine assassins bred for warfare. The creatures’ advanced tech is unlike anything she’s seen, and their escape hints at a larger conspiracy: a shadowy corporation is using them to launch an attack on the city’s power grid, triggering chaos and control.', NULL, NULL, 0, 'concept_ready', '2026-04-20 05:08:34', '2026-04-20 05:08:35'),
(108, 119, 1, 'Episode 1', 'cat and dog', 'In the neon-drenched sprawl of Neo-Citadel, where skyscrapers scrape the clouds and drones patrol like vultures, Cat—a rogue ex-soldier with feline agility and a penchant for chaos—steals a prototype plasma cannon from BlackIron Industries’ vaults. Her target? The weapon’s AI core, which she believes can override the company’s plans to weaponize civilian drones into autonomous killing machines. But when Dog, a stoic enforcer with cybernetic enhancements and unshakable loyalty to his corporate bosses, corners her on the 42nd-floor rooftop, he’s stunned to find her holding not just the cannon but a data chip containing evidence of BlackIron’s secret experiments on prisoners.', NULL, NULL, 0, 'concept_ready', '2026-04-20 05:09:19', '2026-04-20 05:09:19'),
(109, 120, 1, 'Episode 1', 'cat and dog', 'In the neon-drenched sprawl of Neo-Sanctum, where skyscrapers pierce clouds and drones patrol like vultures, ex-soldier Kael Rourke battles for survival after being framed for sabotaging the city’s AI-controlled defense grid. His only allies are Zira, his cybernetic cat—sleek, feral, and capable of hacking through security systems—and Rex, his genetically enhanced dog with plasma-fist claws and infrared vision. When Kael uncovers evidence that the grid’s true purpose is to enslave humanity by erasing free will, he must race against time to expose its creator before it’s too late. The episode opens with Kael evading drones in a high-speed chase through collapsing tunnels beneath the city,.', NULL, NULL, 5, 'images_completed', '2026-04-20 05:10:50', '2026-04-20 05:24:28'),
(112, 121, 1, 'Neo-Tokyo Chronicles: Digital Rebellion', 'cat and dog', 'Captain Marcus Drake and the crew of the starship Horizon are Earth\'s last hope. When a mysterious alien artifact is discovered on Mars, it triggers a countdown that could destroy the solar system. Racing against time, they must decode ancient alien technology, survive treacherous space battles, and make the ultimate sacrifice to save humanity.', NULL, NULL, 5, 'completed', '2026-04-20 05:25:59', '2026-04-20 05:26:08'),
