(106, 'img_69e9aa926e846_1776921234_757acc14066747e9', 826, 195, 1, 'Generate an initial action scene image for \"Neon Nightfall\". Drones slice skyscrapers as neon lights flicker in the rain. The hero strikes a heroic pose, ready for battle. Explosions and sparks fill the background. Dynamic camera angle captures the intensity. Dramatic lighting with rim lights highlighting the hero. Fast-paced energy frozen in a single frame. Cinematic action movie style, high contrast lighting, dynamic composition. 8K resolution, professional stunt photography, film grain. No text, no watermarks, no borders.', 'flux-2-dev', 1, 30, 7.5, '175452847', 'completed', '[\"https:\\/\\/pub-3626123a908346a7a8be8d9295f44e26.r2.dev\\/generations\\/e5a18e3a-766a-4788-8949-42ee7041aae7-0.jpg\"]', NULL, '{\"status\":\"processing\",\"tip\":\"Get 20x faster image generation using enterprise plan. Click here : https:\\/\\/modelslab.com\\/enterprise\",\"eta\":30,\"message\":\"Request queued for processing. Try to fetch request after estimated seconds.\",\"fetch_result\":\"https:\\/\\/modelslab.com\\/api\\/v6\\/images\\/fetch\\/175452847\",\"id\":175452847,\"output\":[],\"future_links\":[\"https:\\/\\/pub-3626123a908346a7a8be8d9295f44e26.r2.dev\\/generations\\/e5a18e3a-766a-4788-8949-42ee7041aae7-0.jpg\"],\"meta\":{\"model_id\":\"flux-2-dev\",\"prompt\":\"Generate an initial action scene image for \\\"Neon Nightfall\\\". Drones slice skyscrapers as neon lights flicker in the rain. The hero strikes a heroic pose, ready for battle. Explosions and sparks fill the background. Dynamic camera angle captures the intensity. Dramatic lighting with rim lights highlighting the hero. Fast-paced energy frozen in a single frame. Cinematic action movie style, high contrast lighting, dynamic composition. 8K resolution, professional stunt photography, film grain. No text, no watermarks, no borders.\",\"negative_prompt\":null,\"self_attention\":null,\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"guidance_scale\":7.5,\"samples\":1,