(781, 181, 186, 1, 'Neon Shadows', '<div class=\"scene-content\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-purple-400 text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Neon Shadows</h3>\n                <p><strong>Episode 1 - Scene 1</strong></p>\n                <p><strong>What happens:</strong> Neon shadows cling to crumbling towers as Kael slips into the lair.</p>\n                <p><strong>Story Concept:</strong> In the neon-drenched sprawl of Neo-Atlanta’s vertical district, where skyscrapers twist like shattered spines and drones hum through smog-choked skies, Kael Voss races against time to rescue his sis...</p>\n            </div>', 'Generate an initial action scene image for \"Neon Shadows\". Neon shadows cling to crumbling towers as Kael slips into the lair. The hero strikes a heroic pose, ready for battle. Explosions and sparks fill the background. Dynamic camera angle captures the intensity. Dramatic lighting with rim lights highlighting the hero. Fast-paced energy frozen in a single frame. Cinematic action movie style, high contrast lighting, dynamic composition. 8K resolution, professional stunt photography, film grain. No text, no watermarks, no borders.', 'http://ai-web-series.local/images/series/186/scenes/781/scene_781_1776851195.png', NULL, 'generating', '2026-04-22 04:23:36', NULL, NULL, 'Neon shadows cling to crumbling towers as Kael slips into the lair.', 'completed', '2026-04-22 04:14:58', '2026-04-22 04:23:36'),
(782, 181, 186, 2, 'Code Betrayal', '<div class=\"scene-content\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-purple-400 text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Code Betrayal</h3>\n                <p><strong>Episode 1 - Scene 2</strong></p>\n                <p><strong>What happens:</strong> Lira’s soldiers ambush Kael in the AI core chamber.</p>\n                <p><strong>Story Concept:</strong> In the neon-drenched sprawl of Neo-Atlanta’s vertical district, where skyscrapers twist like shattered spines and drones hum through smog-choked skies, Kael Voss races against time to rescue his sis...</p>\n            </div>', 'Generate an initial action scene image for \"Code Betrayal\". Lira’s soldiers ambush Kael in the AI core chamber. The hero strikes a heroic pose, ready for battle. Explosions and sparks fill the background. Dynamic camera angle captures the intensity. Dramatic lighting with rim lights highlighting the hero. Fast-paced energy frozen in a single frame. Cinematic action movie style, high contrast lighting, dynamic composition. 8K resolution, professional stunt photography, film grain. No text, no watermarks, no borders.', 'http://ai-web-series.local/images/series/186/scenes/782/scene_782_1776851289.png', NULL, 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lira’s soldiers ambush Kael in the AI core chamber.', 'completed', '2026-04-22 04:14:58', '2026-04-22 04:18:10'),
